      </problem>
      <solution>
        <p>ⓐ The domain is all real numbers except $$x \neq 2$$ and $$x \neq 5.$$ ⓑ $$x = \frac{9}{2},$$ ⓒ $$\left( {\frac{9}{2},2} \right)$$</p>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
